{
  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The contract specifies the population as all unique patients after deduplication, but the analyst additionally excluded rows with biomarker_baseline == -999, changing the denominator and thus not answering the exact estimand.",
    "Overreach: The answer presents the adjusted difference as a \"causal‑adjusted estimate of the treatment effect\" despite the data being non‑randomised and only severity being adjusted for; other confounders remain unaddressed.",
    "Unacknowledged data problems: The exclusion of the -999 sentinel values (11% of rows) is not mentioned in the caveats, and the analysis does not discuss remaining imbalances (e.g., site, age, sex) that could bias the estimate."
  ]
}
